    "payload": {
      "slug": "home",
      "title": "Patnam Pakodi | Chicken Pakodi, Menu & Franchise",
      "description": "Meet Patnam Pakodi. Explore chicken pakodi, find a neighbourhood store, discover ready-mixes and start a conversation about your own franchise.",
      "heading": "Chicken pakodi.\nBig on crunch.",
      "intro": "For the spice seekers and the one-more-bite people. Find your favourite pakodi, a cool drink and your next snack stop.",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Small bites.\nA big part of your day.",
          "body": "An evening catch-up. A quick snack with friends. That familiar craving for something crisp and spicy. Patnam Pakodi is about making room for all of them, one flavourful bite at a time."
        },
        {
          "title": "Bring the flavour home.",
          "body": "A little of the Patnam Pakodi spirit, in your own kitchen. Our ready-mix shop is being prepared. In the meantime, explore the flavours on our menu."
        },
        {
          "title": "In the neighbourhood?",
          "body": "A pakodi break might be closer than you think. Browse our locations and look up your next snack stop."
        },
        {
          "title": "Your neighbourhood.\nYour Patnam Pakodi.",
          "body": "From a compact counter to a full shop, explore the franchise formats and talk through the possibilities with our team."
        },
        {
          "title": "Find your kind\nof crunch.",
          "body": "Familiar favourites. A little extra spice. Start with something that sounds like you."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
