      "slug": "about-us",
      "title": "Our Story | Patnam Pakodi",
      "description": "Get to know Patnam Pakodi, the chicken pakodi brand behind a menu of familiar flavours, neighbourhood snack stops and franchise opportunities.",
      "heading": "A little spice.\nA lot of good company.",
      "intro": "Some of the best plans begin with a snack. Ours begins with chicken pakodi and the people who gather around it.",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "The familiar, with a kick.",
          "body": "Pachi mirchi. Kothimeera. Kaju chicken. Our menu brings together chicken pakodi flavours, saucy favourites, bowls and a little something to cool things down."
        },
        {
          "title": "A place in your day.",
          "body": "Drop in for an evening bite, make a plan with friends or find a flavour you have not tried before. Explore the menu, then find a Patnam Pakodi in your neighbourhood."
        },
        {
          "title": "Make it your own.",
          "body": "Interested in bringing Patnam Pakodi to your neighbourhood? Explore our display, cart, cabin and shop formats, and speak with the team about what fits your plans."
        }
      ]
    }
